WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
<b>Catarina Claes's</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
<b>Glamorous Summer Vacation
Part 1</b>

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.980
<i>Summer vacation is here!</i>

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.540
<i>Thus far, I've been successful 
at avoiding my doom flags,</i>

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.780
<i>but I can't get careless now.</i>

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.820
My latest creation.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.190
This looks perfect!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.830
Thanks, Tom!

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.040
How was that?!

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.010
Um... What in the world...

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.710
I'm practicing throwing toy 
snakes as if they were real!

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.200
If it becomes necessary, 
I can do this to make him drop his guard!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.820
And when would that become necessary?

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.320
It'll be necessary when it's necessary!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.710
Just tell me whether 
it looks natural or not!

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.380
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:34.170
<b>Episode 6 
I Had Fun Over Summer Vacation...</b>

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.160
I just love summer vacation.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.800
With all this free time, 
I can do things I enjoy.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.080
And throwing toys around is 
one of the things you enjoy?

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:43.280
Don't play around too much. 
Remember, we have homework, as well.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:45.660
I'll have to work the fields next!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.700
Lady Catarina.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:51.120
I baked these sweets. 
Would you care to have some?

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.410
Wow, thanks!

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.240
I haven't had your
homemade sweets in so long!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.360
It's delicious!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:04.190
Thank you for looking 
after Catarina at school.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:05.740
I'm sure it's been challenging.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.190
No, not at all.

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:12.920
She changed drastically after she took 
that bump to the head as a child.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.460
She was a selfish brat before, 
and now she's a troublemaker.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:20.090
But many things have changed as a result.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:24.100
For example, the head maid, 
Joana, and the gardener, Tom.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.470
They never opened up to anyone before,

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:29.700
but they seem to enjoy themselves 
so much with Lady Catarina.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.560
That goes for me, as well.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.160
That's true.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:39.470
It's because of her that my husband and I 
can speak honestly with each other now.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:42.620
She's made the entire Claes 
household a brighter—

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:43.670
Heave-ho!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:49.310
She's made the entire household a bri—

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.030
And here we go!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.370
She's made the—

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.290
Heave-ho and here we go!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.540
Heave-ho and—

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.720
Catarina!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.260
Stop belting out those outlandish yells!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:07.260
<b>Catarina Claes's</b>

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:07.260
<b>Glamorous Summer Vacation
Part 2</b>

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:14.680
This year's watermelons were as 
sweet and delicious as last year's.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.450
Yes, they were.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:22.190
The breeze feels so nice. 
It's making me sleepy.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.990
Please, Sister. If you fall asleep out here,

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.910
Mother will scold you again.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.190
That's fine.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:31.660
The grass is really comfy. 
Why don't you try it, too?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.680
I'll pass.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.120
Aww...

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.130
Keith!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:48.020
Come on, hurry up! Race you to that tree!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.160
Wait!

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.280
Keith?

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:06.240
Monster...

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.720
Monster!

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.080
Just get out of here!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:10.430
Mistress's child!

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:13.040
Why are you even here? You're a pest!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.280
Go away already!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:16.800
Keith?

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:18.710
Just disappear!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.920
What's wrong, Keith?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.060
Are you okay?

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.810
Yeah... I just had a scary dream.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:31.020
Oh... You were moaning a lot.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.610
Sorry for worrying you.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.380
It's okay, Keith.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.900
If you have any more scary 
dreams, I'll wake you up!

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.320
Okay.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.170
<i>I never had any more nightmares after that.</i>

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.370
<i>All because she was there for me.</i>

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.310
I want some agar jelly noodles.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.310
Huh?

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.590
Wh-What does that mean?

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.800
Agar jelly noodles are the best in summer!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:19.830
Or... don't you have them in this world?

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.520
You're saying stuff that 
makes no sense again...

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.530
<b>Catarina Claes's</b>

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.530
<b>Glamorous Summer Vacation
Part 3</b>

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.170
It's another hot day...

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.370
Hi, Catarina.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.920
Prince Geordo.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.410
Would you like to go cool off at the lake?

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:47.810
It sure has been hot every day, hasn't it?

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:49.620
It sure has.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:52.260
<i>He's sitting awfully close to 
be complaining about the heat...</i>

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.640
Why did we stop?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.640
Sorry!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.900
Keith?!

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.430
Are you all right, Sister?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.940
What do you mean?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.360
I'm just going to the lake with 
Prince Geordo, that's all.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.600
"That's all"?

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:09.630
That's exactly why you're in danger!

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.490
Weren't you going to a 
big social event today?

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:16.250
I did, and I saw Prince Alan there...

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.610
Geordo went out by himself.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.860
That's why you came after us?

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:23.120
Yes.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.070
<i>I get it!</i>

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:29.090
<i>You wanted to come along with us, didn't you?</i>

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:33.550
<i>Oh, gosh! He was lonely 
because we left him behind!</i>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:37.490
<i>I thought he'd grown up a lot, 
but I guess he's still a child.</i>

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:41.340
Okay, Keith. Why don't you come with us?

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.130
Huh?!

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:48.750
Your tenacity never ceases 
to amaze me, Keith.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.670
Really, it's nothing that special.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.250
<i>They're such good friends.</i>

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.040
Oh, I know!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.440
Since we're all here...

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:02.590
It's beautiful!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:06.160
Yes, it would be the perfect 
place for a date, but...

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:09.180
I wasn't expecting this 
many people to be here...

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:12.670
I thought it would be even 
more fun to invite everyone!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.540
I'm so happy you invited me.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:18.130
I almost fell a step behind.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.930
I'm happy for a chance to go 
on an excursion with you, too.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.490
Yes, truly.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:25.980
Thank you for bringing me along.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.080
There are boats!

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:33.040
Why don't we ride one together?

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:33.760
Okay!

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.020
We don't want anything 
happening to you, Sister.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.400
I'll ride with you, too.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.570
I'm afraid not. 
The boat can't carry that many.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:43.570
Lady Catarina, please ride with me!

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:45.930
It'll be best with two girls!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.590
In that case, I want to ride with you, too!

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:49.600
Me, too!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:54.320
I believe you're all forgetting 
that Catarina is engaged to <i>me</i>.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.700
Yes, <i>for now</i>.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.460
And what might that mean?

00:08:58.460 --> 00:08:59.260
Oh, nothing.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.360
What are they arguing about?

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:03.570
Yeah, I have no idea, either.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.330
Is riding in a boat really that fun?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.170
Huh?

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.680
You don't know how much fun boats are?

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:12.000
I see you're still a child, Prince Alan.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.110
Wh-What?!

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:16.620
We'll have a race to see 
who can row the fastest!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.860
Victory will depend on arm strength,

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:20.740
so I have a good feeling about this!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.860
In that case, I'd say I have 
a better chance of winning!

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:26.570
Then why don't we have a 
showdown, like we used to?

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:29.080
If that's a challenge, I accept!

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.720
I've never ridden in a boat before.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.170
Oh, look! There are fish!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.520
How did this happen?

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:48.730
Because we drew lots. 
There's no changing the results now.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.900
You're good, for someone 
who's never done this before.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.380
You think so?

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.640
Well, I can't let her beat me.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.820
See you at the finish, Prince Alan!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:07.050
Incredible, Lady Catarina! You're amazing!

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.760
Delicious!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:19.600
You really are good at 
making sweets, Miss Maria.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.110
Thank you.

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.840
I'm so glad we were all able to get together.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.360
This'll be a fantastic 
summer vacation memory!

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.590
Yes. I think my brother is 
having a great time, too.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:35.330
I can't really see it...

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:38.910
Look closer. He's smiling 
just a tiny bit, see?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.740
<i>I can't see it at all...</i>

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.420
Hey!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.340
Give that back!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.540
You won't get away!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.430
S-Sister, your skirt!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.830
Worry a little more about who's watching you!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.350
Get back here!

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:04.760
Honestly, that Catarina...

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.780
You never used to smile like that.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.560
Really?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.370
Yeah.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:15.660
Even when you smiled on the 
outside, you still looked bored.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.910
You might be right.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:20.440
But isn't the same true for you, Nicol?

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:25.050
You only smile when you're around her.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.320
That's not...

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:29.580
Hold it!

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:43.700
Honestly, she's always leaving 
herself defenseless...

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:47.970
Keith, just what have they been 
teaching her at the Claes home?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:52.310
I thought she was being taught proper 
manners, like everyone else...

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.980
<b>Catarina Claes's</b>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.980
<b>Glamorous Summer Vacation
Part 4</b>

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.280
Sister, you're going out?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.460
Yes, I'm going shopping with Sophia.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:07.620
She said the latest book in the 
<i>Devilish Count</i> series is out.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.890
For crying out loud!

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:12.420
We've done nothing but play around 
since summer vacation started!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:16.660
Our break should be spent formulating 
a strategy to avoid our doom!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.590
Don't you all agree with me?!

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:22.910
Wh-What are you all doing?!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:27.260
It's summer vacation, so our internal 
meetings are on break, too.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.600
I-If we're going to end up doomed anyway,

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.970
it might be a good idea to enjoy 
this brief respite while we have it.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:35.610
Yeah, we need a break every now and then.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:36.750
No objections.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:37.950
You, too, Chairman?!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.120
Wh-Who are you?

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:51.450
Come and enjoy this vacation with me.

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.250
O-Okay!

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:03.050
My favorite bookstore is just ahead.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.080
I can't wait.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.660
<i>Everyone's looking at us.</i>

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:13.080
<i>These beautiful siblings stand out 
everywhere they go, don't they?</i>

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.350
Hey, I wonder what that shop is.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.090
Want to drop in and see?

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:18.890
Sure!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.840
I bet this would look great on you.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.970
And I think this would look lovely on you.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:29.700
Really?

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:50.010
Wow! Look at all the romance novels!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.690
There are so many that I haven't heard of.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.960
"A Love Story of a Prince and the 
Prince of an Enemy Nation"...

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.610
This sounds interesting!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:13:59.770
Sounds like it runs pretty deep.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.780
Oh, there it is!

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:04.200
The latest book in the <i>Devilish Count</i> series!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.370
Oh, you're right!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.080
I can't wait to read it!

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.560
Isn't it wonderful?

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.560
Yes.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.990
Today was so much fun!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.200
It was.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:24.690
Somehow, I feel as if I spent time 
with you like this before, long ago.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:28.340
Huh? But I don't think we've 
ever gone shopping together.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.840
Yes, you're right.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.200
I'm sure it was something 
I just saw in a dream.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.360
Oh, that's right!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.260
There's something I forgot to buy.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:38.000
I'm going to go back and get it.

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.160
Oh, then I'll go with you.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:44.080
No, that's all right. 
I'll have the servant go with me.

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:48.060
You can just wait here with my brother!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.530
Good luck, Brother!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.320
Bye, now!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.170
W-Wait... Sophia!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.780
There she goes.

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:56.910
Indeed.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.830
Thank you for doing this today.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.690
Huh?

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:02.830
I've never seen Sophia look 
so happy while out in town.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.470
Oh, not at all. 
I had a wonderful time myself.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:07.860
Catarina Claes...

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:14.530
My sister and I are both 
truly happy to have met you.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:16.840
U-Um... Master Nicol?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.700
I know I can't wish for it to last forever,

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:27.360
so for just this instant...

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.450
Let me stay by your side.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:34.200
What?!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.950
I'm back!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.880
Wh-What happened?!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.740
The Devilish Count...

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:42.380
Huh?!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:48.380
<i>Come to think of it, Nicol did 
say there was someone he liked.</i>

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:53.020
<i>There's no one alive who wouldn't 
fall for that kind of charm.</i>

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.550
<b>Catarina Claes's</b>

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.550
<b>Glamorous Summer Vacation
Part 5</b>

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:06.010
There are a lot of women here today.

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:08.600
Prince Alan is going to be performing.

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.480
So that's why...

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.700
Good evening.

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:14.120
I see you're all here, too.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.380
Good evening, President.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:19.500
It's nice to see you during our break!

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:22.410
I'm happy to hear you say that.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.650
These are for you, Prince Alan.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.800
That was a wonderful performance.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.390
Oh... Thanks.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.270
That last song was one I hadn't heard before.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:33.820
Yeah... This was my first 
time performing that one.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.400
It's called "For You, My Dearest One."

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:40.540
Oh... So you played it with 
the person you love in mind?

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.670
W-Well, yeah, maybe...

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.120
But it's not that I love her, exactly...

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:49.090
<i>That reaction...</i>

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:51.840
<i>He definitely had a special someone in mind.</i>

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.100
<i>Is it Mary?</i>

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.500
<i>Or maybe Maria?</i>

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:59.910
Prince Alan, the ladies are 
waiting for you over there.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.940
Shouldn't you go and see them now?

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.100
R-Right... I guess so.

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:09.660
<i>I guess she doesn't like seeing her 
fiancé getting so much attention...</i>

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:13.570
<i>Why does she look so serious?!</i>

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.880
This is dangerous.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.060
I've spent all these years trying 
not to let him realize it...

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.440
I'll have to sow some 
doubt in him again later.

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:23.330
I can't afford any more competition!

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:28.620
<i>I thought Mary didn't like Alan 
that much, unlike in the game,</i>

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:32.750
<i>but maybe her brusque attitude toward 
him is just the other side of her love.</i>

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:37.390
<i>I really hope the one Alan 
loves is Mary, not Maria!</i>

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.290
I've missed being able to 
see you, Master Sirius.

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.540
Me, too.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.090
I wish summer vacation would end sooner.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.610
Um, excuse me for a moment.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:51.720
Miss Catarina!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:55.140
You're very popular, President!

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:56.320
Oh... Thanks.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:01.770
Come to think of it, 
you aren't engaged yet, are you?

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.040
Well, no.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:07.120
There have been offers, but I 
can't seem to settle on anyone.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:11.100
Is there already someone 
you're interested in?

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.290
Someone I'm interested in?

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.220
<i>Crap! Was it rude to ask him that?!</i>

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:19.480
I-I mean...

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:20.420
No.

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:21.050
Huh?

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:24.840
No, there's no one I'm interested in.

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:31.310
Oh, the dance is about to start.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.980
Your partner is waiting 
over there, Miss Catarina.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:37.280
R-Right! If you'll excuse me, then...

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.780
May I have this dance, Catarina?

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.050
Y-Yes.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.530
Let's dance, too, Prince Alan.

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:48.870
R-Right...

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.840
<b>Catarina Claes's</b>

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.840
<b>Glamorous Summer Vacation
Part 6</b>

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.550
Help me, Keith!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.770
I haven't finished this homework 
assignment! This one, either!

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.720
You haven't even started it!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:10.360
Every time I asked, you said 
you were working on it!

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.560
W-Well, I did do a little bit of it!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:16.380
You mean these two measly lines 
you wrote on this one page?!

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.490
I'm sorry.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:24.220
It's partially my fault, too, 
for believing you without question.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:26.000
Ouch, little brother...

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.360
Anyway...

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.630
We have to go back to school tomorrow,

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.600
so you need to get this taken care of today.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.430
I'll help you.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.330
Right...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.250
Sister, I've finished this one.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:43.040
Thanks, Keith!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.430
I'm almost done, too.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:45.740
Need help?

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:47.690
I'll be fine. You can go to bed.

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:48.590
But...

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:49.640
Really, it's fine!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.410
All right. Good luck, then.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:54.110
Sure.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:02.370
<i>I always did my summer homework on the last 
day of break in my previous life, too...</i>

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.460
How's it going with <i>Fortune Lover</i>? 
Making progress?

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:15.600
Uh... I conquered the cocky 
prince and the frivolous guy,

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:18.380
but the black-hearted, 
sadistic prince is pretty tough.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.800
Catarina just keeps getting in the way.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.250
I've already completed all the routes!

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.630
What? Already?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.160
You're so quick, Acchan...

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:30.760
There's one route that 
was really hard, though.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:31.990
Wanna know which one?

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:33.790
W-Wait, don't! No spoilers!

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.010
It was...

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.300
Lady Catarina, it's morning. 
You need to wake up.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.290
No... I don't wanna hear it...

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:41.950
I don't wanna hear it, I said! No!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:39.620
Lady Catarina...

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:41.730
Lady Catarina!

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:46.120
O-Oh... Good morning.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.110
Yes, a good morning to you.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.140
I feel like I had a really nostalgic dream...

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:52.740
A dream?

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:55.940
Yeah, the dream I had just now.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:58.490
I forgot it as soon as I woke up, though.

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:02.750
You've very tired after spending the 
whole night doing your homework.

00:22:03.950 --> 00:22:04.750
My homework?!
